      "content": "Hey, I'm looking over the shortlist for the Director of Ops role. Marcus Vane is on there. His stats are insane, but I'm a bit worried about the culture fit. Our environment is pretty aggressive and high-pressure—we move fast and break things. Looking at his notes, he seems a bit... steady? How does he actually fit into a culture like ours? Does he have that drive we need?",
