    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting way to spin it. But I don't know... when I read his interview responses about decision-making, he talks a lot about consensus and thorough deliberation. In this role, I need someone who can make a gut call in thirty seconds when a trade is going sideways. If he spends three days building a consensus, we lose. Do you really think he can actually handle the raw aggression required here, or is he just a good manager for a more stable company?",
